#!csharp

// Deze code laad de Polygot plugin die nodig is om te communiceren met SQL Server.
// Voer deze code uit voordat je SQL Server gerelateerde cellen uitvoert.
#r "nuget:Microsoft.DotNet.Interactive.SqlServer, *-*"

#!csharp

// Je mag deze code niet aanpassen en moet deze NIET begrijpen.
// Voer deze code uit voordat je SQL Server gerelateerde cellen uitvoert.

using Microsoft.DotNet.Interactive;
using Microsoft.DotNet.Interactive.Commands;

var shortName = "SqlServer";             
var fullName  = $"sql-{shortName}";

var kernels = Kernel.Root.FindKernels(k => k.Name == fullName);

if (!kernels.Any())
{
    await Kernel.Root.SendAsync(new SubmitCode(
        @"#!connect mssql --kernel-name SqlServer --connection-string ""Server=localhost,1433;Database=Databases;User Id=sa;Password=Pass.Word;TrustServerCertificate=True;"""
    ));
}

#!markdown

## Opgave 1 - (3 punten)

Geef

- De titel
- De URL ('[https://leetcode.com'](https://leetcode.com&#39;) met de questionSlug er achter)
- Of het om een premium probleem gaat (in tekstvorm)
- De frequentie waarmee de vraag gesteld wordt op sollicitaties

voor alle vragen die

- Geen voorbeeld bevatten, telkens de tekst 'example:' in de beschrijving staat, wordt gezien als een voorbeeld.
- Een moeilijkheidsgraad van 3 hebben
- Met frequentie van minstens 75 procent voorkomen bij sollicitaties

Sorteer het resultaat op frequentie.

**Verwacht resultaat:**

| | Title | URL | Is Premium | Frequency |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1| Trapping Rain Water | https://leetcode.com/problems/trapping-rain-water | Free | 96.3 |
| 2| Text Justification | https://leetcode.com/problems/text-justification | Free | 95.5 |
| 3| Minimum Difficulty of a Job Schedule | https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-difficulty-of-a-job-schedule | Free | 93.7 |
| 4| Integer to English Words | https://leetcode.com/problems/integer-to-english-words | Free | 88.3 |
| 5| Find Median from Data Stream | https://leetcode.com/problems/find-median-from-data-stream | Free | 87.3 |
| 6| Basic Calculator | https://leetcode.com/problems/basic-calculator | Free | 86.4 |
| 7| Median of Two Sorted Arrays | https://leetcode.com/problems/median-of-two-sorted-arrays | Free | 86.2 |
| 8| Consecutive Numbers Sum | https://leetcode.com/problems/consecutive-numbers-sum | Free | 86.1 |
| 9| Word Ladder | https://leetcode.com/problems/word-ladder | Free | 84.2 |
| 10| Merge k Sorted Lists | https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-k-sorted-lists | Free | 83.2 |
| 11| Maximum Profit in Job Scheduling | https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-profit-in-job-scheduling | Free | 82.7 |
| 12| LFU Cache | https://leetcode.com/problems/lfu-cache | Free | 81.8 |
| 13| Strong Password Checker | https://leetcode.com/problems/strong-password-checker | Free | 80 |
| 14| Sliding Window Maximum | https://leetcode.com/problems/sliding-window-maximum | Free | 79.4 |
| 15| First Missing Positive | https://leetcode.com/problems/first-missing-positive | Free | 77.3 |
| 16| Critical Connections in a Network | https://leetcode.com/problems/critical-connections-in-a-network | Free | 76.3 |
| 17| Alien Dictionary | https://leetcode.com/problems/alien-dictionary | Premium | 75.7 |
| 18| Regular Expression Matching | https://leetcode.com/problems/regular-expression-matching | Free | 75 |

#!sql-SqlServer

SELECT title                                        AS Title,
       CONCAT('https://leetcode.com', questionSlug) AS URL,
       CASE isPremium
           WHEN 1 THEN 'Premium'
           ELSE 'Free'
           END                                      AS [Is Premium],
       frequency                                    AS Frequency
FROM Leetcode.Question
WHERE description NOT LIKE '%example:%'
  AND difficultyId = 3
  AND frequency >= 75
ORDER BY frequency DESC;

#!markdown

## Opgave 2 - (3 punten)

Geef voor de vragen die met een frequentie groter dan 95% gesteld worden en waarvoor er geen Python oplossingen (discussions) zijn, de titel, moeilijkheidsgraad en frequentie. 
Sorteer het resultaat aflopend op de frequentie waarmee de vraag gesteld word.

**Verwacht resultaat**

| | title | Difficulty | frequency |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1| LRU Cache | Easy | 99.2 |
| 2| Robot Bounded In Circle | Easy | 98.5 |
| 3| Number of Islands | Easy | 97.8 |
| 4| Merge Intervals | Easy | 97.1 |
| 5| Trapping Rain Water | Hard | 96.3 |
| 6| Text Justification | Hard | 95.5 |

#!sql-SqlServer

-- Oplossing met outer join
SELECT Q.title, Diff.name AS Difficulty, Q.frequency
FROM Leetcode.Question AS Q
         JOIN Leetcode.Difficulty Diff ON Q.difficultyId = Diff.id
         LEFT JOIN Leetcode.Discussion Disc ON Q.id = Disc.questionId
WHERE Disc.id IS NULL AND Q.frequency > 95
ORDER BY frequency DESC

#!sql-SqlServer

-- Oplossing met subquery
SELECT Q.title, Diff.name AS Difficulty, Q.frequency
FROM Leetcode.Question AS Q
         JOIN Leetcode.Difficulty Diff ON Q.difficultyId = Diff.id
WHERE Q.id NOT IN (SELECT questionId FROM Leetcode.Discussion) AND Q.frequency > 95
ORDER BY Q.frequency DESC

#!markdown

## Opgave 3 - (3 punten)

Geef de titels van alle vragen die gerelateerd zijn aan de vraag die met de hoogste frequentie gesteld wordt.

**Verwacht resultaat**

| | title |
| :--- | :--- |
| 1| 3Sum |
| 2| 4Sum |
| 3| Two Sum II - Input array is sorted |
| 4| Two Sum III - Data structure design |
| 5| Subarray Sum Equals K |
| 6| Two Sum IV - Input is a BST |
| 7| Two Sum Less Than K |
| 8| Max Number of K-Sum Pairs |
| 9| Count Good Meals |

#!sql-SqlServer

SELECT title
FROM Leetcode.Question
WHERE id IN (SELECT similarQuestionId
             FROM Leetcode.SimilarQuestion
             WHERE questionId IN (SELECT TOP 1 Q.id
                                  FROM Leetcode.Question Q
                                  ORDER BY Q.frequency DESC))

#!markdown

